6. FILE FORMATS

   The .tsaphstruct and .tsaphloot file formats are documented in this
   Software's public documentation. You may read, write, and distribute files
   in these formats using your own independent implementation, provided that
   such implementation is written entirely from the public documentation and
   does not reproduce any Proprietary Code. No royalty or additional
   permission is required for format-compatible implementations.

